    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-tristis</span></b> , e, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>somewhat
			sad</i> or <i>sorrowful</i> (ante- and post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subtristis visus est mihi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					And. 2, 6, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 107,
				9</span></i>.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cera subtristior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 60, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
